calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of Crittenden County&rsquo;s 8 grids came in under 90% of normal in February to March and in October to November in 36 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle ran 197% of normal in April to May and 42% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 56% on the middle. Grid 18459 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
